Subject: [PATCH 10/10] collab: serve remote live voice from headless RPC hosts

Register a terminal-independent adapter before collaboration starts. Keep the
real live controller, Codex authentication, attestation and delegation, with
remote-only capture and playback. Drain voice across replacement and disposal.

Guard guest ownership across duplicate claims, pending starts and teardown so
old completions and media cannot affect a replacement call. Forward the existing
transport abort signal and make presentation-only level updates optional.

